          "end": 329.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"rights.\"",
          "start": 329.82,
          "end": 331.57,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You have to talk them out of it, somehow.",
