        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 2703.57,
          "end": 2703.89,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 2703.89,
          "end": 2704.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " sins.",
          "start": 2704.15,
          "end": 2704.95,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because in that dimension, we will see what we really look like, how much we really develop, and how much we lack development.",
