          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Very alive, Not well.",
      "start": 2739.65,
      "end": 2741.05,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Very",
          "start": 2739.65,
          "end": 2739.81,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " alive,",
          "start": 2739.81,
          "end": 2740.31,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Not",
          "start": 2740.53,
          "end": 2740.55,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " well.",
          "start": 2740.55,
          "end": 2741.05,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Also, God lets us understand, as Laurie explained about 44, how they will try to sneak into Heaven and they'll find it worse than Hell.",
