          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " idols,",
          "start": 3004.65,
          "end": 3005.35,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Allaat, Manaat, Al-\u2018Uzzah and all that. They were in the Ka\u2018bah that Abraham built.",
