          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " sent",
          "start": 3024.81,
          "end": 3024.81,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3024.81,
          "end": 3024.97,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Quran",
          "start": 3024.97,
          "end": 3025.17,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3025.17,
          "end": 3025.37,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Muhammad,",
          "start": 3025.37,
          "end": 3025.87,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and sent Muhammad to tell the people \"the idols are bad. Worship God alone. Worship God alone.\" So, what happened?",
