          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " persecuted.",
          "start": 3385.77,
          "end": 3386.02,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They had to be special people, because the easiest thing is to go along with the masses, with the crowds.",
