          "start": 3445.19,
          "end": 3445.35,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " alone.",
          "start": 3445.35,
          "end": 3445.75,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He knows they lost the Prayer. They probably never prayed.",
