          "end": 3537.79,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " lucky.",
          "start": 3537.79,
          "end": 3538.59,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We are a first generation, just like Abraham's generation, Muhammad's generation.",
