          "speaker": "Lisa"
        },
        {
          "word": " verse,",
          "start": 4607.95,
          "end": 4608.47,
          "speaker": "Lisa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This verse, to me, expresses it very, very clearly and very, very beautifully.",
