          "end": 4634.21,
          "speaker": "Lisa"
        },
        {
          "word": " can",
          "start": 4634.21,
          "end": 4634.37,
          "speaker": "Lisa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You can hear it and you can say \"yes\", but then you get sidetracked.",
