          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " 41",
          "start": 4742.13,
          "end": 4742.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep. 41 means hell.",
