          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " We",
          "start": 5008.29,
          "end": 5008.31,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " were",
          "start": 5008.31,
          "end": 5008.43,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We were really advanced in science.",
