          "end": 5021.93,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " fact,",
          "start": 5021.93,
          "end": 5022.21,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In fact, this is for chemists.",
