          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 5022.49,
          "end": 5022.71,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " chemists.",
          "start": 5022.71,
          "end": 5023.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " If",
          "start": 5023.45,
          "end": 5023.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " any",
          "start": 5023.45,
          "end": 5023.83,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If any chemist is here, this is the last thing you do to find out if there is, for example, radioactivity in the ashes of anything.",
