          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " 100%",
          "start": 5034.39,
          "end": 5034.91,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " oxygen.",
          "start": 5034.91,
          "end": 5035.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5036.23,
          "end": 5036.31,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 5036.31,
          "end": 5036.39,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And you create a spark.",
      "start": 5036.39,
      "end": 5038.63,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " create",
          "start": 5036.39,
          "end": 5036.61,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 5036.61,
          "end": 5036.83,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " spark.",
          "start": 5036.83,
          "end": 5037.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5038.15,
          "end": 5038.39,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " everything",
          "start": 5038.39,
          "end": 5038.63,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And everything will be combusted into ashes.",
      "start": 5038.63,
      "end": 5042.37,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " will",
          "start": 5038.63,
          "end": 5038.83,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " be",
          "start": 5038.83,
          "end": 5039.07,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " combusted",
          "start": 5039.07,
          "end": 5039.49,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " into",
          "start": 5039.49,
          "end": 5039.77,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " ashes.",
          "start": 5039.77,
          "end": 5040.03,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " This",
          "start": 5042.23,
          "end": 5042.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5042.23,
          "end": 5042.37,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is what happened to the three astronauts.",
      "start": 5042.37,
      "end": 5045.03,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " what",
          "start": 5042.37,
          "end": 5042.37,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " happened",
          "start": 5042.37,
          "end": 5042.57,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5042.57,
          "end": 5042.71,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5042.71,
          "end": 5042.81,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " three",
          "start": 5042.81,
          "end": 5042.95,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " astronauts.",
          "start": 5042.95,
          "end": 5043.3,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5044.93,
          "end": 5044.93,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5044.93,
          "end": 5045.03,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is why God didn't give us 100% oxygen. We have 20% oxygen. The rest is nitrogen.",
      "start": 5045.03,
      "end": 5051.77,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5045.03,
          "end": 5045.13,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " why",
          "start": 5045.13,
          "end": 5045.19,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 5045.19,
          "end": 5045.37,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " didn't",
          "start": 5045.37,
          "end": 5045.73,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " give",
          "start": 5045.73,
          "end": 5045.89,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " us",
          "start": 5045.89,
          "end": 5046.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " 100%",
          "start": 5046.25,
          "end": 5047.41,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " oxygen.",
          "start": 5047.41,
          "end": 5047.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " We",
          "start": 5048.09,
          "end": 5048.13,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " have",
          "start": 5048.13,
          "end": 5048.21,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " 20%",
          "start": 5048.21,
          "end": 5048.77,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " oxygen.",
          "start": 5048.77,
          "end": 5049.53,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 5049.59,
          "end": 5049.59,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " rest",
          "start": 5049.59,
          "end": 5049.75,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5049.75,
          "end": 5049.93,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " nitrogen.",
          "start": 5049.93,
          "end": 5050.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5051.53,
          "end": 5051.61,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5051.61,
          "end": 5051.77,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is what they do now when they send astronauts into space.",
      "start": 5051.77,
      "end": 5058.43,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5051.77,
          "end": 5051.85,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " what",
          "start": 5051.85,
          "end": 5051.91,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " they",
          "start": 5051.91,
          "end": 5052.07,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " do",
          "start": 5052.07,
          "end": 5052.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " now",
          "start": 5052.23,
          "end": 5052.47,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " when",
          "start": 5052.47,
          "end": 5053.53,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " they",
          "start": 5053.53,
          "end": 5053.67,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " send",
          "start": 5053.67,
          "end": 5053.89,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " astronauts",
          "start": 5053.89,
          "end": 5055.81,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " into",
          "start": 5055.81,
          "end": 5056.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " space.",
          "start": 5056.23,
          "end": 5056.63,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 5058.23,
          "end": 5058.27,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 5058.27,
          "end": 5058.43,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But we learned the hard way.",
      "start": 5058.43,
      "end": 5062.87,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " learned",
          "start": 5058.43,
          "end": 5058.61,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5058.61,
          "end": 5058.79,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " hard",
          "start": 5058.79,
          "end": 5058.93,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " way.",
          "start": 5058.93,
          "end": 5059.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 5060.71,
          "end": 5061.97,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " despite",
          "start": 5062.61,
          "end": 5062.87,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, despite our...",
      "start": 5062.87,
      "end": 5063.93,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " our...",
          "start": 5062.87,
          "end": 5063.67,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 5063.75,
          "end": 5063.75,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " mean,",
          "start": 5063.75,
          "end": 5063.93,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, we were sending people to the moon.",
      "start": 5063.93,
      "end": 5067.17,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 5063.93,
          "end": 5063.97,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " were",
          "start": 5063.97,
          "end": 5064.03,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " sending",
          "start": 5064.03,
          "end": 5064.33,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " people",
          "start": 5064.33,
          "end": 5064.75,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5064.75,
          "end": 5064.97,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5064.97,
          "end": 5065.09,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " moon.",
          "start": 5065.09,
          "end": 5065.54,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5066.77,
          "end": 5067.05,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 5067.05,
          "end": 5067.17,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And we couldn't give them the correct atmosphere.",
      "start": 5067.17,
      "end": 5072.43,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " couldn't",
          "start": 5067.17,
          "end": 5067.67,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " give",
          "start": 5067.67,
          "end": 5068.85,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " them",
          "start": 5068.93,
          "end": 5069.09,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5069.09,
          "end": 5069.31,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " correct",
          "start": 5069.31,
          "end": 5069.55,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " atmosphere.",
          "start": 5069.55,
          "end": 5070.25,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 5072.21,
          "end": 5072.29,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " these",
          "start": 5072.39,
          "end": 5072.43,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, these few verses here will make us appreciate God if we think of sending our own astronauts into space.",
      "start": 5072.43,
      "end": 5084.81,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " few",
          "start": 5072.43,
          "end": 5072.69,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " verses",
          "start": 5072.69,
          "end": 5073.05,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " here",
          "start": 5073.05,
          "end": 5073.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
