          "end": 5296.19,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " only",
          "start": 5296.19,
          "end": 5296.39,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " son.",
          "start": 5296.39,
          "end": 5297.04,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " So",
          "start": 5297.85,
          "end": 5298.05,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " when",
          "start": 5298.05,
          "end": 5298.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you tell them, when you confront them with that \"only son\" business, because Ishmael was 14 years older than Isaac.",
